{"id":7578,"date":"2021-06-30T17:52:27","date_gmt":"2021-06-30T21:52:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7578"},"modified":"2021-06-30T17:52:27","modified_gmt":"2021-06-30T21:52:27","slug":"our-day-trip-to-cumberland-falls","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/06\/30\/our-day-trip-to-cumberland-falls\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Day Trip to Cumberland Falls"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We&#8217;ve been camp hosting at Dale Hollow Lake State Resort Park since the middle of April and our time here is quickly coming to a close.  We try to get a away from the park periodically to see the surrounding area.  Although the weekends find the park full and it&#8217;s necessary for us to be here, the weekdays are very quiet and so that&#8217;s when we take off and do a little sight-seeing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This week we heard about 76 Falls and Cumberland Falls.  Although we&#8217;ve been to Niagara Falls and we&#8217;ve seen 15 or 20 of the falls of the <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/28\/waterfalls-in-michigan-really\/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"4022\">Upper Penninsula of Michigan<\/a>, we wanted to see what this part of Kentucky had to offer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>76 falls is located just north of State Route 90 near Albany.  It&#8217;s part of the extreme southwest corner of Lake Cumberland and offers a wonderful hideaway for the folks vacationing in one of the many rental houseboats on the lake.  The small picnic area at the top of the falls, along with the steps up to the overlook were most likely built by the CCC (Civilian Conservation Corps) back in the 30&#8217;s as part of FDR&#8217;s plan to revitalize the country by getting able-bodied men and women back to work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083605958.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083605958.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7579\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083605958.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083605958-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083605958-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083707078.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083707078.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7580\" class=\"wp-image-7580\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083707078.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_083707078-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">What goes down .. must come up<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084150372.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084150372.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7582\" class=\"wp-image-7582\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084150372.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084150372-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084150372-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Houseboat near base of falls<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_085259516.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_085259516.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7583\" class=\"wp-image-7583\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_085259516.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_085259516-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_085259516-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Hard to see the falls through the foliage (falls at the left)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084120694.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084120694.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7584\" class=\"wp-image-7584\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084120694.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084120694-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_084120694-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Looking down at the top of the falls<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We moved on from 76 Falls and continued north and east to <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/parks.ky.gov\/corbin\/parks\/resort\/cumberland-falls-state-resort-park?gclid=CjwKCAjwrPCGBhALEiwAUl9X0xISWnHNeNfqFx5LovmY_LwU6lsGyvkg6NtbQA0Mxtb33BEnCfA1ohoCg7wQAvD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\">Cumberland Falls State Resort Park<\/a>.  It&#8217;s located right on State Route 90 southwest of Corbin, KY and alongside the Cumberland River.  The state park is actually inside Daniel Boone National Forest!  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Capture.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"403\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7596\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Capture.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Capture-300x159.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Capture-685x363.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>You can see in this map the relationship between where we are working (Dale Hollow), Lake Cumberland, and Cumberland Falls.  Dale Hollow is the lake at the bottom of the photo mostly in Tennessee, Lake Cumberland is the lake closest to Monticello, and Cumberland Falls as marked<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This park has a beautiful lodge that was also built by the CCC in the 30&#8217;s and has been tastefully modernized while still keeping the historical and architectural value of a property nearly 100 years old.  There are 51 lodging rooms, a restaurant on the lower level, a large veranda overlooking the Cumberland River, and a nearby campground with 50 camp sites, cottages, and cabins for rent.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115404288.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115404288.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7594\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115404288.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115404288-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115404288-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/Cumberland-Falls.mp4\"><\/video><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120847633.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120847633.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7585\" class=\"wp-image-7585\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120847633.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120847633-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120847633-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115554422.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115554422.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7586\" class=\"wp-image-7586\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115554422.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115554422-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_115554422-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Adjacent to meeting rooms, originally the Dining Room<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120134842.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120134842.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7587\" class=\"wp-image-7587\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120134842.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120134842-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120134842-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">View of the Cumberland River from the veranda<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120230541.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120230541.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7588\" class=\"wp-image-7588\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120230541.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120230541-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120230541-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The main lobby<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120947026.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120947026.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7589\" class=\"wp-image-7589\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120947026.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120947026-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_120947026-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_121919058.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_121919058.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7590\" class=\"wp-image-7590\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_121919058.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_121919058-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_121919058-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122359796_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122359796_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7591\" class=\"wp-image-7591\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122359796_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122359796_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122359796_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">See the rainbow?<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122425743.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122425743.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7592\" class=\"wp-image-7592\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122425743.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122425743-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_122425743-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Hot summer day, cool mist from the falls, and a rainbow to boot!<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Before we left, I had the opportunity to set up my portable ham radio station down by the river (found a great shaded spot) and worked a couple dozen stations both stateside and abroad.  A great afternoon away with my sweetheart!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_135609029.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_135609029.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7598\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_135609029.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_135609029-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/06\/IMG_20210622_135609029-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for visiting.  Remember, you can subscribe by entering your email address in the box and then you will automatically get an email anytime we have an update here on the blog.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope to see you down the road &#8230;. in the meantime &#8230; be good to yourself and those you love!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb &amp; Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We&#8217;ve been camp hosting at Dale Hollow Lake State Resort Park since the middle of April and our time here is quickly coming to a close. We try to get a away from the park periodically to see the surrounding area. Although the weekends find the park full and it&#8217;s necessary for us to be &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/06\/30\/our-day-trip-to-cumberland-falls\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Our Day Trip to Cumberland Falls<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7585,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[19546,554707329],"tags":[554707955,554707953,554707938,554707242,59349,554707952,554707954,554707427,554707435],"class_list":["post-7578","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-76-falls","tag-albany","tag-dale-hollow","tag-ham-radio","tag-kentucky","tag-lake-cumberland","tag-monticello","tag-state-park","tag-waterfall"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7578","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7578"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7578\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7599,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7578\/revisions\/7599"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7585"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7578"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7578"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7578"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}